{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013KS8dQEC9gqE94zeTYmmbu","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have a complete picture. Let me compile my findings:\n\n## Summary of MLE Rounds Code Path - Per-AIR Kernel Launches\n\nBased on my comprehensive analysis of the CUDA backend prover codebase, here are the exact locations and structures for the per-AIR kernel launches during MLE sumcheck rounds:\n\n### 1. **Main Entry Point: `sumcheck_polys_batch_eval` Function**\n\n**File:** `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs`\n**Lines:** 1131-1517\n\nThis function orchestrates all kernel launches for a single MLE round. The structure:\n\n- **Lines 1167-1281**: Phase 1 - Processes **per-AIR metadata collection**\n  - Iterates through `self.n_per_trace` (one per AIR/trace)\n  - Splits traces into Case A (round > n_lift) and Case B (round <= n_lift)\n  - For Case B, collects column pointers and metadata for batched interpolation\n\n- **Lines 1283-1321**: Phase 2 - **Batched column interpolation** (single kernel launch for all Case B traces)\n  - Call: `batched_interpolate_columns_gpu()` at line 1314\n\n- **Lines 1323-1384**: Phase 3 - Builds TraceCtx for each Case B trace (CPU-only, no kernels)\n\n- **Lines 1388-1428**: **Late traces (num_y=1) evaluation** - Uses **monomial kernels** called from:\n  - **Line 1400**: `LogupMonomialBatch::new()` → calls `logup_monomial_batched()` CUDA kernel\n  - **Line 1419**: `ZerocheckMonomialBatch::new()` → calls `zerocheck_monomial_batched()` CUDA kernel\n\n- **Lines 1431-1444**: **Early logup traces** - Calls `evaluate_logup_batched()`\n\n- **Lines 1447-1514**: **Early zerocheck traces** - Calls `evaluate_zerocheck_batched()`\n\n### 2. **Precompute Lambda Combinations Kernels**\n\n**File:** `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.rs`\n**Lines:** 79-100 (Rust wrapper)\n\n**CUDA Kernel File:** `/home/jorge/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.cu`\n**Lines:** 60-96 (CUDA kernel definition)\n\n```rust\n// Per-AIR, called once after lambda is sampled (in initialize_sumcheck at line 789)\npub(crate) fn compute_lambda_combinations<HS: GpuHashScheme>(\n    pk: &DeviceMultiStarkProvingKey<GenericGpuBackend<HS>>,\n    air_idx: usize,\n    lambda_pows: &DeviceBuffer<EF>,\n) -> Result<DeviceBuffer<EF>, CudaError>\n```\n\n**Called at initialization (Line 786-793):**\n```rust\nfor (air_idx, air_pk) in self.pk.per_air.iter().enumerate() {\n    if air_pk.other_data.zerocheck_monomials.is_some() {\n        self.lambda_combinations[air_idx] = Some(\n            compute_lambda_combinations(self.pk, air_idx, lambda_pows_ref)\n                .map_err(LogupZerocheckError::LambdaCombinations)?,\n        );\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Kernel signature (CUDA):**\n```cuda\n__global__ void precompute_lambda_combinations_kernel(\n    FpExt *__restrict__ out,\n    const MonomialHeader *__restrict__ headers,\n    const LambdaTerm *__restrict__ lambda_terms,\n    const FpExt *__restrict__ lambda_pows,\n    uint32_t num_monomials\n)\n```\n\n### 3. **Precompute Logup Combinations Kernels**\n\n**File:** `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.rs`\n**Lines:** 509-580 (Rust wrapper)\n\n**CUDA Kernels:** `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.cu`\n**Lines:** 303-364\n\nTwo variants:\n- **Numerator combinations** (Line 531): `precompute_logup_numer_combinations()`\n- **Denominator combinations** (Line 550): `precompute_logup_denom_combinations()`\n\n**Kernel signatures (CUDA):**\n```cuda\ntemplate <bool IS_DENOM>\n__global__ void precompute_logup_combinations_kernel(\n    FpExt *__restrict__ out,\n    const MonomialHeader *__restrict__ headers,\n    const InteractionMonomialTerm *__restrict__ terms,\n    const FpExt *__restrict__ beta_pows,\n    const FpExt *__restrict__ eq_3bs,\n    uint32_t num_monomials\n)\n```\n\n**Called at initialization (Lines 843-860):**\n```rust\nfor (trace_idx, (air_idx, _)) in ctx.per_trace.iter().enumerate() {\n    let air_pk = &self.pk.per_air[*air_idx];\n    if air_pk.other_data.interaction_monomials.is_some()\n        && !self.eq_3b_per_trace[trace_idx].is_empty()\n    {\n        self.logup_combinations[trace_idx] = Some(\n            compute_logup_combinations(\n                self.pk, *air_idx,\n                &self.d_beta_pows,\n                &self.d_eq_3b_per_trace[trace_idx],\n                &self.eq_3b_per_trace[trace_idx],\n                &self.beta_pows,\n            )\n            .map_err(LogupZerocheckError::LogupCombinations)?,\n        );\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. **Monomial Evaluation Kernels - Per-AIR Usage**\n\n**File:** `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.rs`\n\n#### **ZerocheckMonomialBatch (Low num_y traces)**\n**Lines:** 111-267\n\n**Usage in sumcheck_polys_batch_eval:**\n- **Lines 1410-1427** (late traces with num_y=1)\n- **Lines 1499-1514** (early traces, low num_y <= threshold)\n\n**Constructor (Line 127):**\n```rust\npub fn new<HS: GpuHashScheme>(\n    traces: impl IntoIterator<Item = &'a TraceCtx>,\n    pk: &DeviceMultiStarkProvingKey<GenericGpuBackend<HS>>,\n    lambda_combinations: &[&DeviceBuffer<EF>],\n) -> Result<Self, MemCopyError>\n```\n\n**Block structure (Lines 152-167):**\n- Per-trace: `mono_blocks = ceil(num_monomials / THREADS_PER_BLOCK)`\n- Total blocks per trace: `mono_blocks * num_y`\n- Encoding: `local_block_idx_x = y_int * mono_blocks + mono_block`\n\n**CUDA kernel:** `zerocheck_monomial_batched()` (batch_mle_monomial.cu lines 153-192)\n\n#### **ZerocheckMonomialParYBatch (High num_y traces)**\n**Lines:** 281-469\n\n**Usage in sumcheck_polys_batch_eval:**\n- **Lines 1476-1497** (early traces, high num_y > threshold)\n\n**Constructor (Line 303):**\n```rust\npub fn new<HS: GpuHashScheme>(\n    traces: impl IntoIterator<Item = &'a TraceCtx>,\n    pk: &DeviceMultiStarkProvingKey<GenericGpuBackend<HS>>,\n    lambda_combinations: &[&DeviceBuffer<EF>],\n    sm_count: u32,\n    num_x: u32,\n    max_monomials_per_thread: Option<u32>,\n) -> Result<Self, MemCopyError>\n```\n\n**Block structure (Lines 376-389):**\n- Per-trace: `y_blocks = ceil(num_y / THREADS_PER_BLOCK_PAR_Y)`\n- Per-trace: `air_mono_chunks = ceil(num_monomials / chunk_size)`\n- Total blocks per trace: `y_blocks * air_mono_chunks`\n- Encoding: `local_block_idx_x = y_block * air_mono_chunks + mono_chunk`\n\n**CUDA kernel:** `zerocheck_monomial_par_y_batched()` (batch_mle_monomial.cu lines 258-295)\n\n#### **LogupMonomialBatch**\n**Lines:** 588-793\n\n**Usage in sumcheck_polys_batch_eval:**\n- **Lines 1389-1408** (late traces with interactions, num_y=1)\n- **Lines 1521-1542** (early traces with interactions, low num_y <= threshold)\n\n**Constructor (Line 607):**\n```rust\npub fn new<HS: GpuHashScheme>(\n    traces: impl IntoIterator<Item = &'a TraceCtx>,\n    pk: &DeviceMultiStarkProvingKey<GenericGpuBackend<HS>>,\n    logup_combinations: &[&LogupCombinations],\n) -> Result<Self, MemCopyError>\n```\n\n**Block structure (Lines 631-650):**\n- Per-trace: `max_monomials = max(num_numer_monomials, num_denom_monomials)`\n- Per-trace: `mono_blocks = ceil(max_monomials / THREADS_PER_BLOCK_LOGUP)`\n- Total blocks per trace: `num_y * mono_blocks`\n- Encoding: `local_block_idx_x = y_int * mono_blocks + mono_block`\n\n**CUDA kernel:** `logup_monomial_batched()` (batch_mle_monomial.cu lines 444-495)\n\n### 5. **Batched MLE Evaluation Kernels**\n\n**File:** `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle.rs`\n\n#### **ZerocheckMleBatchBuilder (DAG-based constraints)**\n**Lines:** 113-254\n\n**Called from `evaluate_zerocheck_batched()`:**\n**Lines:** 414-502\n\nUsage:\n- Filters traces by constraints and memory budget\n- Single kernel launch: `evaluate_mle_constraints_gpu_batch()` at line 244\n\